        "text": "**Choosing a Provider**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Cloud Pub/Sub, as a suitable managed messaging service, in my `publish_event.py` script. The next step is to integrate it in the code. I aim to create a clean and identifiable implementation to ensure clarity and avoid future confusion. I also need to make sure the code is flexible and can be adapted to other services in the future.\n\n\n**Selecting Pub/Sub**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on integrating Google Cloud Pub/Sub within the `publish_event.py` script. The goal is a clear, adaptable setup. The code's structure requires that I include the necessary imports and client initialization to make the provider choice clear and adaptable. I'm building it with the future in mind, intending to support other messaging services. I need to populate the project and topic IDs.\n\n\n",
